# Two players in 1st Manassas (BULLRUN1.CIV): the main menu's first entry, twice, makes the
# Confederate player Union and then BOTH SIDES. Each side rests every unit, and a key passes
# play to the other side ("press any key to switch", the otherside routine of order, which
# once left its GOSUB by EXIT SUB and GOTO; docs/devnotes.md, item 9). Digests at each side's
# first three commands, at the time limit and at both sides' results.
#! seed 5
#! timeout 600

rule 1 key space
rule 5 key space
rule 2:C key enter
rule 2:P key enter
rule 2:S key enter

# Player: Union, then BOTH SIDES.
play until 2:M
text p
play until 2:M
digest
text p
play until 2:M
digest

# Load File, BULLRUN1.CIV; Fight.
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key right
prompt
key enter
play until 2:M
key enter

# The first three commands of each side.
repeat 3
play until 5:C
digest
key space
play until 5:U
digest
key space
end

# The time limit: End Game. Each side's results.
play until 2:T
digest
key enter
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
digest
key space

# Quit, Yes.
play until 2:M
digest
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
